Photocatalytic Degradation of Monolithron and Linuron in an Aqueous Suspension of Titanium Dioxide under Simulated Solar Irradiation

Razika Zouaghr

Laboratoire des Sciences et Technologie de l'Environnement, Universite de Montorri, Constantine, Algeria

